@startuml
title N01 - Node sensing
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #2877B5
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #17324D
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1BF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9C6500
left to right direction
component "N01\nNode sensing" as N01
interface "QualifiedInput::sample(raw_level, now_ms); stable_level()" as API
database "Owned state\nraw/stable level, edge timestamp, debounce and retrigger clocks" as State
queue "Input / output\nRaw PIR/reed level → optional qualified Motion/DoorOpen/DoorClosed event kind" as IO
API --> N01
IO --> N01
N01 --> State : owns
component "S01\nShared contracts" as S01
N01 ..> S01 : contract / port
component "N05\nNode storage" as N05
N01 ..> N05 : contract / port
component "N02\nNode radio" as N02
N01 ..> N02 : contract / port
note bottom of N01
Flow: Initialize without emitting; record raw edge; require stability for debounce interval; enforce retrigger interval; emit only a qualified transition.
Guard: Bounce and repeated PIR holds are suppressed. Initial level is state, not an invented event. Queueing and persistence happen outside this module.
Status: Host complete; target pending
end note
@enduml
